## WHITE SPACE — ENHANCE THESE

These are our strongest differentiators. Build them well.

1. **Seat lineage as append-only hash chain** — Every seat event (mint, escrow, transfer, offer accepted) gets SHA-256 hashed and chained. This is our core provenance system. Make it clean, auditable, and independently verifiable.

2. **Dual-signature verification** — Every seat instrument gets two signatures: ECDSA (classical) + ML-DSA/FIPS 204 (post-quantum). This is real differentiation. Implement both.

3. **Server-side signed verification receipts** — The `/verify/{serial}` endpoint returns a platform-signed receipt with the full lineage. Any party can verify. This is NOT a blockchain lookup — it's a signed document served by our API.

4. **Agent constitutional frame hashing** — When an agent registers or acts, its governance constraints are hashed and recorded. This creates an auditable proof that the agent operated within bounds. Build this as a real protocol boundary with measurable security outcomes.

5. **Transaction firewall** — Agents discover and stage. Humans confirm and pay. This boundary is architectural, not a UI choice. No code path should allow an agent to execute a financial transaction.

6. **Sell-through gate as deterministic state machine** — Wave N+1 cannot activate until Wave N seats_sold == seats_total. No override. No admin bypass. No exception. Enforce this structurally.

7. **Fixed-price waves with deterministic multiplier** — Price is `base × 1.6^(wave-1)`. Transparent, predictable, non-negotiable per wave. This is how we differ from auctions and bid systems.

